data: {"id": "b39f763b9fef450f-thinking-parallel_evidence-5578", "run_id": "b39f763b9fef450f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论\n\n**1. 实体身份与生命周期确认**\n*   **实体**：`aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974`\n*   **当前状态**：**异常 (Pending / ContainerCreating)**\n*   **Pod UID**：`9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`\n*   **所属控制器**：ReplicaSet `workload-5b5fc86c8c` -> Deployment `workload`\n*   **调度节点**：`node2`\n*   **生命周期阶段**：Pod 已调度（`PodScheduled=True`），`Initialized=True`，但因容器未就绪导致 `ContainersReady=False`。\n\n**2. 根因定位（支持/反驳候选原因）**\n*   **直接原因（支持）**：Kubernetes Events 明确记录 **`FailedMount`**，错误原文为：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for vo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789045212533, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "b39f763b9fef450f-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "b39f763b9fef450f", "seq": 5579, "ts_ms": 1789045217439, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 36.302, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/b39f763b9fef450f-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "f58d048e5e8f766f666aea7616af626d2f6882cc1994460b4c80f4a0d0ded72e", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "6f0632caaa49896aad10c6fdd6b30f10f319916ffab1af6fc48783b14b2ba7bf"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "b39f763b9fef450f-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "b39f763b9fef450f", "seq": 5580, "ts_ms": 1789045217440, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "b39f763b9fef450f-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "b39f763b9fef450f", "seq": 5581, "ts_ms": 1789045226814, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.374, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1757, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 中定义的 Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致 kubelet 挂载失败，Pod 无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-2ae5c6efbdcf) | `pod.status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 整体处于未就绪状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-5b7298830a14) | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` | 说明容器调度成功，但处于初始化/挂载等待阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes (diagnosis) | Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' | 指出导致挂载失败的直接配置原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-2063d74dcf98) | `Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 核心事实：明确报错缺失 ConfigMap 导致挂载失败 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-d6c29399fab4) | `Warning FailedMount: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 佐证挂载行为失败且超时 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus (fact-05cf094e202b) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason {reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立确认当前容器状态为创建中，与 K8s 事件原因吻合 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 状态与事件 (1-4) 与 Metric 监控 (6) 均指向 `ContainerCreating` 状态。证据 #4 提供了决定性事实，说明该状态是由 ConfigMap 缺失导致的 `FailedMount`，从而阻断了容器的启动流程；证据 #3 从配置层面补充了这一事实的根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 (证据#3) → Kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 (证据#4) → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 (证据#1, #2) → 应用服务不可用 (证据#6)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在**（见证据 #3, #4）。\n这导致 kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时无法找到对应资源，引发 `FailedMount` 错误（证据 #4, #5），进而使 Pod 永久卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 #2, #6）。\n\n现有证据充分确认了挂载失败的原因及结果，诊断状态为 `diagnosed`。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 中定义的 Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致 kubelet 挂载失败，Pod 无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-2ae5c6efbdcf) | `pod.status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 整体处于未就绪状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-5b7298830a14) | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` | 说明容器调度成功，但处于初始化/挂载等待阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes (diagnosis) | Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' | 指出导致挂载失败的直接配置原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-2063d74dcf98) | `Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 核心事实：明确报错缺失 ConfigMap 导致挂载失败 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-d6c29399fab4) | `Warning FailedMount: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 佐证挂载行为失败且超时 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus (fact-05cf094e202b) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason {reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立确认当前容器状态为创建中，与 K8s 事件原因吻合 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 状态与事件 (1-4) 与 Metric 监控 (6) 均指向 `ContainerCreating` 状态。证据 #4 提供了决定性事实，说明该状态是由 ConfigMap 缺失导致的 `FailedMount`，从而阻断了容器的启动流程；证据 #3 从配置层面补充了这一事实的根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 (证据#3) → Kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 (证据#4) → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 (证据#1, #2) → 应用服务不可用 (证据#6)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在**（见证据 #3, #4）。\n这导致 kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时无法找到对应资源，引发 `FailedMount` 错误（证据 #4, #5），进而使 Pod 永久卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 #2, #6）。\n\n现有证据充分确认了挂载失败的原因及结果，诊断状态为 `diagnosed`。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "b39f763b9fef450f-final", "run_id": "b39f763b9fef450f", "seq": 5583, "ts_ms": 1789045226825, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod 中定义的 Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，导致 kubelet 挂载失败，Pod 无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-2ae5c6efbdcf) | `pod.status: Pending` | 确认 Pod 整体处于未就绪状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-5b7298830a14) | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` | 说明容器调度成功，但处于初始化/挂载等待阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes (diagnosis) | Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' | 指出导致挂载失败的直接配置原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-2063d74dcf98) | `Warning FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 核心事实：明确报错缺失 ConfigMap 导致挂载失败 |\n| 5 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-d6c29399fab4) | `Warning FailedMount: Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` | 佐证挂载行为失败且超时 |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus (fact-05cf094e202b) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason {reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立确认当前容器状态为创建中，与 K8s 事件原因吻合 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 状态与事件 (1-4) 与 Metric 监控 (6) 均指向 `ContainerCreating` 状态。证据 #4 提供了决定性事实，说明该状态是由 ConfigMap 缺失导致的 `FailedMount`，从而阻断了容器的启动流程；证据 #3 从配置层面补充了这一事实的根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 (证据#3) → Kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 (证据#4) → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 (证据#1, #2) → 应用服务不可用 (证据#6)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 定义中引用的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 `aiops-case-03` 中不存在**（见证据 #3, #4）。\n这导致 kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时无法找到对应资源，引发 `FailedMount` 错误（证据 #4, #5），进而使 Pod 永久卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 #2, #6）。\n\n现有证据充分确认了挂载失败的原因及结果，诊断状态为 `diagnosed`。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 81.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 36.3s (Evidence 31.4s, RCA 4.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 126.678, "metrics": {"run_id": "b39f763b9fef450f", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 126.68412184715271, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 126684.12184715271, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 123311.8827342987, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_too